# AtlaswebX Environment Configuration
# This file is for future environment-specific settings
# Currently, API keys are managed through the Settings UI in the application

# Note: API Keys are NOT stored in .env anymore
# To configure your OpenAI API key:
# 1. Launch AtlaswebX
# 2. Go to Settings (gear icon)
# 3. Navigate to AI Settings
# 4. Enter your OpenAI API key
# 5. Click Save

# Your API keys are securely stored in the application's local storage
